#
# Counter-example for math:UnanchoredDiagnosticShape (Rule D1): a math:ModelDiagnostic
# naming the math:FittedModel it evaluates through math:diagnosticFor (so the sh:minCount 1
# fitted-model arm is SATISFIED) but omitting math:diagnosticMethod, tripping the method
# arm's sh:minCount 1 — shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:UnanchoredDiagnostic).
# Single violation: the fitted model it points at is well-formed — bound to its data through
# math:fittedToData and specified through math:modelFormula — so math:UnfittedModel stays
# silent, and the fitted-model arm stays satisfied, so EXACTLY ONE finding fires, no sibling.
# Back-reference: math:UnanchoredDiagnostic (slices/grounding/math/module.ttl).
# Negative counterpart of conformance-fixtures/diagnostic-anchored.ttl.
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecDiagnosticUnanchored).
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/math/> .

# A diagnostic naming its fit but NO method — only the method arm fires.
ex:methodlessDiagnostic a math:ModelDiagnostic ;
    math:diagnosticFor ex:trialFit .    # fit present, but NO math:diagnosticMethod

# The fit it evaluates: a well-formed math:FittedModel, so no math:UnfittedModel fires.
ex:trialFit a math:FittedModel ;
    math:fittedToData ex:trialData ;
    math:modelFormula ex:trialFormula .

ex:trialData a math:DatasetMatrix .
ex:trialFormula a math:ModelFormula ;
    math:argumentSlot ex:trialSlot0 .
ex:trialSlot0 a math:ArgumentSlot ;
    math:slotIndex 0 ;
    math:slotExpression ex:trialResponse .
# Scaffolding, not the defect under test: a formula term is a FREE variable, so its
# occurrence resolves to a declaration with a domain. Left bare, it is separately
# math:UnscopedVariableOccurrence, which would cost this counter-example its isolation.
ex:trialResponse a math:VariableExpression ; math:variableOccurrence ex:trialResponseOccurrence .
ex:trialResponseOccurrence a math:VariableOccurrence ; math:declaredVariable ex:trialResponseDeclaration .
ex:trialResponseDeclaration a math:FreeVariableDeclaration ;
    math:variableDomain ex:trialResponseDomain ;
    rdfs:label "the trial response variable"@x-gmeow-english .
ex:trialResponseDomain a math:Set ;
    rdfs:label "the observed value set of the trial response variable"@x-gmeow-english .
